{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"853","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Planning"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Helen works in Metropolis airport. She is responsible for creating a departure schedule. There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" flights that must depart today, the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them is planned to depart at the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th minute of the day."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Metropolis airport is the main transport hub of Metropolia, so it is difficult to keep the schedule intact. This is exactly the case today: because of technical issues, no flights were able to depart during the first "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes of the day, so now the new departure schedule must be created."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"All "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" scheduled flights must now depart at different minutes between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(k + 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(k + n)"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th, inclusive. However, it's not mandatory for the flights to depart in the same order they were initially scheduled to do so — their order in the new schedule can be different. There is only one restriction: no flight is allowed to depart earlier than it was supposed to depart in the initial schedule."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Helen knows that each minute of delay of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th flight costs airport "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" burles. Help her find the order for flights to depart in the new schedule that minimizes the total cost for the airport."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ n ≤ 300 000"},{"kind":"text","text":"), here "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the number of flights, and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the number of minutes in the beginning of the day that the flights did not depart."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c1, c2, ..., cn"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ci ≤ 107"},{"kind":"text","text":"), here "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the cost of delaying the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th flight for one minute."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line must contain the minimum possible total cost of delaying the flights."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line must contain "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" different integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t1, t2, ..., tn"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k + 1 ≤ ti ≤ k + n"},{"kind":"text","text":"), here "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ti"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the minute when the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th flight must depart. If there are several optimal schedules, print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 2\n4 2 1 10 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"20\n3 6 7 4 5 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let us consider sample test. If Helen just moves all flights "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes later preserving the order, the total cost of delaying the flights would be "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(3 - 1)·4 + (4 - 2)·2 + (5 - 3)·1 + (6 - 4)·10 + (7 - 5)·2 = 38"},{"kind":"text","text":" burles. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"However, the better schedule is shown in the sample answer, its cost is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(3 - 1)·4 + (6 - 2)·2 + (7 - 3)·1 + (4 - 4)·10 + (5 - 5)·2 = 20"},{"kind":"text","text":" burles."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"853A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/853/problem/A"}